    "created_at": "2019-01-09T09:51:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-09T09:51:46Z",
    "body": "Heya, whatwg/html is the place for HTML feature requests. I transferred the issue for you. https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features and https://whatwg.org/working-mode might help you get a feel for how the WHATWG operates.\r\n\r\nAs for this particular feature, it doesn't seem that hard to implement yourself?\r\n```js\r\nsomeControl.oninput = _ => {\r\n  if(someControl.validity.valid) { // or use someControl.checkValidity() if you want another invalid event\r\n    hideParagraphFor(someControl);\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```",
